{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-oxford-terraces","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"oxford-terraces-iman-developers-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Oxford Terraces is an ultra-modern six-storey apartment complex by Iman Developers, located in Jumeirah Village Circle, Dubai. The complex offers studio and 1-2 bedroom apartments. Thoughtful and functional interiors, made in a modern style, perfectly complemented by a neutral color scheme, which makes the residences even more spacious.Oxford Terraces is a dream place to live. With every amenity, from the elegant double-height lobby to the gazebo and verandas that offer breathtaking views of the neighborhood, these apartments offer a tranquility like no other home!Residents of the complex can enjoy a wide range of services and amenities, including a gym equipped with imported equipment that is only available in a few select fitness studios in Dubai. There is an adult pool with a changing stall, a garden area and barbecue facilities on the rooftop.Residents can control their overall energy consumption via an app with smart controls for lighting, air conditioning and curtains.From the complex, it takes approximately 21 minutes to Dubai Mall, 16 minutes to Palm Jumeirah, 17 minutes to Burj Al Arab and 20 minutes to Walk JBR. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately 26 minutes away and the new Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately 31 minutes away.","price":1200000,"title":"Oxford Terraces","bitrix":{"id":725,"pf_id":"are.3.11871","source":null,"project_id":"District 11","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Oxford Terraces","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"IMAN Developers","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1744/images/2024/04/26/340x252/uNIxDPt4WInAMibXedcoP5RMXw0jVoCCJa7n1aCm.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpj